DevOps Freshers – Be Interview Ready!

In the last few weeks, I have seen many freshers struggling to crack DevOps interviews.

Not because they don’t know the answer but because they don’t know what type of questions will be asked.

So here is a solid list of DevOps questions that most recruiters ask in Fresher & 1 Year experience interviews.

💡 If you are preparing, start with these 

🔥 DevOps Fresher-Level Interview Questions

 What is DevOps and why is it needed?
 Difference between DevOps & traditional SDLC?
 What is Continuous Integration & Continuous Deployment?
 What tools are used for CI/CD?
 What is Jenkins and how does it work?
